      "content": "but that's just words. resilience is for people who actually have something to go back to. i don't have a career, i don't have my research, and i don't have a future. it's like the engine of my whole life just stopped. how am i supposed to just 'be someone' when the only thing that made me human was my mind and that's basically broken now? everything feels so pointless.",
